on).\n\nThe hash_location_strategy.ts should override the `generateNavigationUrl` method and return the string with \"#\" + url passed. \n\nThe location.ts should expose a new method `normalizedNavigationUrl` which should accept a stringified instruction just like `normalizeAbsolutely` and internally call normalizeAbsolutely and pass that output to 'generateNavigationUrl' of the platformStrategy\n\nFinally router_link.ts should be modified to use the new `normalizedNavigationUrl` instead of `normalizeAbsolutely` in the `set routeParams` method\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/142820206/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"rvramesh","id":366183,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjE4Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366183?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh","html_url":"https://github.com/rvramesh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvramesh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/146739378","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/4333#issuecomment-146739378","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular